@startuml cicd_monitoring
title Trade ETL Pipeline - CI/CD Deploy Gate & Monitoring

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "GitHub" {
  [Repo: code + dbt + terraform] as Repo
  [Actions: dbt_ci / terraform_ci] as CI
  [production Environment\n(required reviewer)] as Env
}

cloud "Terraform Cloud" {
  [Remote state\n(CLI-driven, execution: local)] as TFState
}

node "Local machine / CI runner" {
  [Terraform CLI] as TF
}

cloud "Snowflake (Trial Account)" {
  [fct_rejected_trades] as Rejected
  [HIGH_REJECTION_RATE Alert] as Alert
  [TRADE_ETL_ALERT_EMAIL\nnotification integration] as Integration
}

node "Docker: Apache Airflow" {
  [Webserver] as Web
}

node "Email inbox" as Inbox

Repo --> CI : push / PR
CI --> "Snowflake (Trial Account)" : validate\n(dbt build / terraform plan)
CI --> Env : merge to main\ntriggers deploy job
Env --> "Snowflake (Trial Account)" : approved:\nterraform apply /\ndbt run --target dev
TF --> TFState : shared state\n(local run or CI, same source of truth)
Rejected ..> Alert : condition query,\n60-minute schedule
Alert --> Integration : action, if\n>10 rejections/hour
Integration --> Inbox : SYSTEM$SEND_EMAIL
Web ..> Inbox : email_on_failure\n(Airflow task retries exhausted)

note bottom of Env
  Required reviewer, admin bypass disabled,
  restricted to main branch. This gate is not
  hypothetical caution - a real incident (a
  case-mismatch bug briefly revoking a live
  role grant) was caught here. See
  docs/architecture.md's "CI/CD hardening"
  section.
end note

@enduml
